   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Release Teaser\n\nA sixteen-second release announcement: five short statements resolve from the center outward over an extreme close-up of a dark, beveled open ring, then the camera pulls back to the ring behind the release lockup and the light recedes while the name holds. Silent: sound is added by the host.\n\nCategory: templates. Length: 16.016 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A sixteen-second release announcement built on anticipation and a final brand reveal.\n- The story fits five short statements, with a dimensional mark as the visual thread.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The video must show real product interactions and workflows: use launch-anything.\n- You want to introduce a whole palette, typography and photography system: use brand-guidelines.\n\nVariables:\n- brand_name (string): Brand name, default \"Orvio\"\n- release (string): Release, default \"2\"\n- tagline (string): Tagline, default \"Your next chapter starts here.\"\n- statement_1 (string): Statement 1, default \"Start with an idea\"\n- statement_2 (string): Statement 2, default \"Make room\\nfor better work\"\n- statement_3 (string): Statement 3, default \"Bring every detail to life\"\n- statement_4 (string): Statement 4, default \"Move together.\\nGo further.\"\n- statement_5 (string): Statement 5, default \"A fresh chapter.\\nNo starting over.\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#9BC8DD\"\n- background (color): Background, default \"#050709\"\n- surface (color): Surface, default \"#151C22\"\n- foreground (color): Text, default \"#F2F5F7\"\n- muted (color): Muted text, default \"#A4ADB5\"\n- light_intensity (number, 0-2): Light intensity, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
